{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandboxels</strong> is a  falling-sand simulator featuring heat simulation, electricity, density, chemical reactions, cooking, and fire spread. With over 500 unique elements to play with, Sandboxels is a great way to pass the time and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664820/extras/Sandboxels.png?t=1745117153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the classic Sandboxels browser game on Steam with no advertisements, bigger screen space, and to support the developer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are thousands of interactions between the many materials, plants, animals, fluids, and powders in the game. Experiment with chemistry, cook food, grow an ecosystem, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simply click or use your touchscreen to select a category, like <strong>Liquids</strong>, then pick an element, like <strong>Water</strong>. Drag on the canvas above to place your pixels, and watch them interact with others!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664820?t=1745117153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664820/6a1ad56fa2800f71f572ed82654f54ab94805121/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745117153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664820/2cdfdd7d97fb200d3dbe6e2dd6eb9e011eb6093d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745117153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664820/2cdfdd7d97fb200d3dbe6e2dd6eb9e011eb6093d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745117153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandboxels</strong> is a  falling-sand simulator featuring heat simulation, electricity, density, chemical reactions, cooking, and fire spread. With over 500 unique elements to play with, Sandboxels is a great way to pass the time and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664820/extras/Sandboxels.png?t=1745117153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the classic Sandboxels browser game on Steam with no advertisements, bigger screen space, and to support the developer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are thousands of interactions between the many materials, plants, animals, fluids, and powders in the game. Experiment with chemistry, cook food, grow an ecosystem, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simply click or use your touchscreen to select a category, like <strong>Liquids</strong>, then pick an element, like <strong>Water</strong>. Drag on the canvas above to place your pixels, and watch them interact with others!</p>","developers":["R74n"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664820/5a38bbd2d1ed7118e4818fd48c33294f64e1a3c5/header.jpg?t=1745117153","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125065,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571